{"seq":2,"slug":"lufs-loudness","title":"响度标准 LUFS","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/mastering/dynamics-loudness/lufs-loudness","wordCount":1343,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"响度标准-lufs\">响度标准 LUFS</h1><p>十年前的母带世界被&quot;响度战争&quot;主宰：谁的歌在电台和 CD 里更响，谁就显得更有冲击力，于是工程师把作品越压越响，动态被一步步榨干。流媒体的归一化（normalization）从根本上终结了这场战争——平台不再让更响的歌更响，而是把每首歌统一拉到同一个响度参考。理解 LUFS 这把&quot;感知响度的尺子&quot;，以及各平台如何用它归一，是 2026 年母带工程师做响度决策的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>LUFS（Loudness Units Full Scale）是基于 ITU-R BS.1770 标准的感知响度度量。它和单纯的峰值或 RMS 不同，因为它模拟了人耳的特性：用 K 加权滤波（K-weighting）模拟人耳对中高频更敏感，再做门限（gating）排除静音段，最后积分出一个反映&quot;人听起来有多响&quot;的数值。</p>\n<p>LUFS 有三种时间尺度，母带交付主要看集成值：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[音频信号] --&gt; B[K 加权滤波&lt;br/&gt;模拟人耳灵敏度]&#10;  B --&gt; C[均方能量计算]&#10;  C --&gt; D1[Momentary&lt;br/&gt;400 ms 窗]&#10;  C --&gt; D2[Short-term&lt;br/&gt;3 s 窗]&#10;  C --&gt; D3[Integrated&lt;br/&gt;整曲 + 门限]&#10;  D3 --&gt; E[交付的核心指标&lt;br/&gt;对照平台目标]&#10;  D1 -.瞬时监看.-&gt; F[捕捉最响段]&#10;  D2 -.动态趋势.-&gt; F\">flowchart TD\n  A[音频信号] --&gt; B[K 加权滤波&lt;br/&gt;模拟人耳灵敏度]\n  B --&gt; C[均方能量计算]\n  C --&gt; D1[Momentary&lt;br/&gt;400 ms 窗]\n  C --&gt; D2[Short-term&lt;br/&gt;3 s 窗]\n  C --&gt; D3[Integrated&lt;br/&gt;整曲 + 门限]\n  D3 --&gt; E[交付的核心指标&lt;br/&gt;对照平台目标]\n  D1 -.瞬时监看.-&gt; F[捕捉最响段]\n  D2 -.动态趋势.-&gt; F</pre><p>下表区分三种 LUFS 及其用途：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>时间窗</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Momentary（瞬时）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>400</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">400</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">400</span></span></span></span></span> ms</td>\n<td>监看瞬间峰值响度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Short-term（短时）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> s</td>\n<td>观察段落间动态趋势</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Integrated（集成）</td>\n<td>整曲（带门限）</td>\n<td>交付核心，对照平台目标</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>与 LUFS 配套的还有两个量：LRA（Loudness Range，响度范围，反映动态跨度，单位 LU）和 dBTP（真峰值，守编码余量）。这三者一起，构成母带交付时要同时盯住的&quot;响度三件套&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"各平台归一目标-2026\">各平台归一目标（2026）</h2><p>流媒体平台都用集成 LUFS 作为归一参考，但参考值并不完全一致。根据 2026 年的公开资料，主流平台的目标如下表所示：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>平台</th>\n<th>归一参考（集成 LUFS）</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Spotify</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>14</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-14</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">14</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>基于 ITU-1770；可选更响档位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>YouTube</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>14</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-14</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">14</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>始终开启，不上调更安静的歌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tidal</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>14</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-14</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">14</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>支持专辑级归一</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Amazon Music</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>14</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-14</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">14</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>与主流一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Apple Music</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>参考更低（&quot;Sound Check&quot;）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>来源：<a href=\"https://soundplate.com/streaming-loudness-lufs-table/\">Soundplate 2026 LUFS 表</a>、<a href=\"https://www.izotope.com/en/learn/mastering-for-streaming-platforms\">iZotope: Mastering for streaming</a>、<a href=\"https://blog.imseankim.com/loudness-mastering-lufs-streaming-platforms-spotify-apple-music-2026/\">imseankim 2026 LUFS 指南</a>。</p>\n<p>关键的工程含义是：在 2026 年，主流平台已经收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>14</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-14</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">14</span></span></span></span></span> LUFS 左右，因此<strong>你不需要为每个平台做不同响度的母带</strong>。一份做得好的母带——集成响度合理、真峰值守在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> dBTP——就能在所有平台上表现良好。Apple Music 参考更低（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span></span></span>），但它的 Sound Check 会按比例调整，无需单独交付。</p>\n<h2 id=\"归一化如何终结响度战争\">归一化如何终结响度战争</h2><p>理解归一逻辑，才能明白&quot;做得过响&quot;为什么不再有意义。平台的规则很简单：测量你的集成 LUFS，若高于参考值，就整体调低（turn down）使其对齐；多数平台不会把比参考更安静的歌调高（turn up），以免抬升底噪。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[上传母带] --&gt; B[平台测集成 LUFS]&#10;  B --&gt; C{响于参考?}&#10;  C --&gt;|是, 如 -8 LUFS| D[整体调低至 -14&lt;br/&gt;动态不被恢复]&#10;  C --&gt;|否, 如 -16 LUFS| E[多数平台不上调&lt;br/&gt;保持原样]&#10;  D --&gt; F[听众听到 -14]&#10;  E --&gt; F\">flowchart TD\n  A[上传母带] --&gt; B[平台测集成 LUFS]\n  B --&gt; C{响于参考?}\n  C --&gt;|是, 如 -8 LUFS| D[整体调低至 -14&lt;br/&gt;动态不被恢复]\n  C --&gt;|否, 如 -16 LUFS| E[多数平台不上调&lt;br/&gt;保持原样]\n  D --&gt; F[听众听到 -14]\n  E --&gt; F</pre><p>这里藏着一个反直觉但关键的事实：当你把母带压到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span> LUFS，平台把它调低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span> dB 回到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>14</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-14</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">14</span></span></span></span></span>。结果是——你榨干动态换来的&quot;响&quot;被白白抹掉了，但被你压扁的瞬态和被你削平的动态却恢复不回来。于是过响的母带在归一后反而显得更扁、更没冲击。这就是所谓的&quot;响度惩罚&quot;（loudness penalty）。换句话说，归一化把&quot;做更响&quot;从一个竞争优势变成了一个净亏损——除非更响是出于音乐风格的主动选择，而非盲目竞赛。</p>\n<p>这条逻辑直接连到<a href=\"dynamic-range-musicality\">动态范围与音乐性</a>：既然平台会把响度拉平，真正决定听感优劣的就回到了动态与音乐性本身。</p>\n<h2 id=\"把-lufs-落到母带决策里\">把 LUFS 落到母带决策里</h2><p>LUFS 不是用来&quot;卡死一个数字&quot;的，而是用来给响度决策提供锚点。实践中的工作流是：先按风格定一个合理的集成响度目标（流行约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">9</span></span></span></span></span><del><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-11</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">11</span></span></span></span></span>、Trap 约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span></del><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span>、独立民谣约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-11</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">11</span></span></span></span></span>~<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>13</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-13</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">13</span></span></span></span></span>，数据见 <a href=\"https://blog.imseankim.com/loudness-mastering-lufs-streaming-platforms-spotify-apple-music-2026/\">imseankim</a>），让限制器（见<a href=\"compression-limiting\">压缩与限制</a>）推到该目标，同时真峰值表守住 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> dBTP，再用集成 LUFS 表确认落点。</p>\n<p>下表把&quot;响度三件套&quot;在交付时的判断标准列出来：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>看什么</th>\n<th>安全区间</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>集成 LUFS</td>\n<td>整体响度落点</td>\n<td>按风格定，多在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span>~<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>13</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-13</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">13</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>dBTP</td>\n<td>编码安全余量</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le -1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> dBTP</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LRA</td>\n<td>动态跨度是否被榨干</td>\n<td>不过低（风格相关）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>要特别注意 LUFS 与风格的关系：嘻哈、电子可以做得很响而不显得过分，因为它们本就密集；而爵士、古典、原声民谣若被压到同样响度会失去呼吸。所以&quot;目标 LUFS&quot;是风格函数，不是一个放之四海的常数。专辑内的曲目响度一致性如何把握，则关系到<a href=\"../delivery/sequencing-spacing\">序列与曲间</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>LUFS 是基于 ITU-R BS.1770 的感知响度度量，用 K 加权 + 门限模拟人耳；交付看集成值，配套 LRA 与 dBTP 构成&quot;响度三件套&quot;。</li>\n<li>2026 年主流平台（Spotify/YouTube/Tidal/Amazon）已收敛到约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>14</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-14</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">14</span></span></span></span></span> LUFS，Apple Music 参考 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span></span></span>；一份好母带通吃所有平台，无需逐平台单做。</li>\n<li>归一化终结了响度战争：平台把过响的歌调低却不恢复其动态，过度压缩换来&quot;响度惩罚&quot;，做更响成了净亏损。</li>\n<li>目标 LUFS 是风格函数（流行 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">9</span></span></span></span></span><del><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-11</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">11</span></span></span></span></span>、Trap <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span></del><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span>、民谣 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-11</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">11</span></span></span></span></span>~<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>13</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-13</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">13</span></span></span></span></span>），由限制器执行、真峰值守 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> dBTP。</li>\n<li>既然响度被拉平，听感优劣回到动态与音乐性本身，详见<a href=\"dynamic-range-musicality\">动态范围与音乐性</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"响度标准 LUFS","id":"响度标准-lufs"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"各平台归一目标（2026）","id":"各平台归一目标-2026"},{"level":2,"text":"归一化如何终结响度战争","id":"归一化如何终结响度战争"},{"level":2,"text":"把 LUFS 落到母带决策里","id":"把-lufs-落到母带决策里"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"压缩与限制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/mastering/dynamics-loudness/compression-limiting"},"next":{"title":"动态范围与音乐性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/mastering/dynamics-loudness/dynamic-range-musicality"}}